      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "化学驱配方筛选业务问题",
          "html": "<p>实验周期长（单配方数周），配方空间大，靠经验设计实验只能覆盖很小一部分。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 235\" role=\"img\"><title>化学驱配方智能筛选业务对象示意</title><rect x=\"30\" y=\"95\" width=\"590\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#ece8d8\"/><path d=\"M145 22V151H457V22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#21796a\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><path d=\"M250 120l-20-26m20 57-25 35m135-35 28-42m-28 42 25 34\" stroke=\"#b96b38\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"47\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"17\">注入参数</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"17\">产出或监测</text><text x=\"257\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"17\">储层 · 流体 · 响应</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>化学驱配方智能筛选涉及的业务对象示意；图中关系不是现场工艺设计。窄屏可在图内滚动。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "配方响应与核回归筛选",
          "html": "<p>聚合物与表活剂用量共同影响驱替效率，盐度又会改变配方表现，实验人员需要在有限试验资源下筛出优先验证的组合。AI用局部核回归比较配方浓度与矿化度的归一化距离，让邻近实验对预测贡献更大，再在成本约束内搜索候选浓度。预测与残差范围一起交付，帮助实验人员明确下一轮重点测试的区域。</p><p>系统自动遍历浓度组合，在预算内排序并交付前5组候选，附上预测驱替效率、费用和探索残差半宽，减少实验人员逐配方查相近记录、手动估算及筛选的环节。评价集误差与观测预测对照图展示模型在哪些效率区间偏离较大，实验人员可据此安排复测或补充样本，把后续岩心试验集中到值得比较的浓度组合。</p><p><b>默认教学演示用120组参考实验的驱替效率均值作基线，在30组评价实验上的MAE为6.48个百分点；局部核回归在同一评价集的MAE为4.81个百分点，误差下降25.86%。</b></p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"局部核回归配方筛选默认合成计算图\"><title>局部核回归配方筛选默认合成计算图</title><text x=\"82\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#355a4b\">核回归预测 / %</text><path d=\"M82 274H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">15.2</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">20.0</text><path d=\"M82 220.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"225.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">32.6</text><text x=\"241.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">35.0</text><path d=\"M82 167H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">50.0</text><text x=\"401\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">50.0</text><path d=\"M82 113.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"118.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">67.4</text><text x=\"560.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">65.0</text><path d=\"M82 60H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">84.8</text><text x=\"720\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">80.0</text><circle cx=\"441.57493150827537\" cy=\"159.31741372506406\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"435.98017962509425\" cy=\"159.951461163187\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"418.05024979809133\" cy=\"158.92081774730084\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"309.87464578734625\" cy=\"167.48283951614064\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"380.9329575104066\" cy=\"167.95868502200727\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"365.64111890180936\" cy=\"164.49931959919587\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"246.4275157725705\" cy=\"172.86992733126675\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"443.1348538364315\" cy=\"157.51269379540963\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"316.43859155897167\" cy=\"169.8564007005\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"525.2724017457765\" cy=\"152.3305886227676\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"507.2421434586934\" cy=\"150.54369816711886\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"422.39975964651734\" cy=\"159.29156255764195\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"520.0517740983412\" cy=\"150.36054980600215\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"271.3384814602757\" cy=\"171.2200561987973\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"410.9712078770019\" cy=\"157.85998476289652\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"558.479028295994\" cy=\"147.85509867554794\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"433.87869810690864\" cy=\"154.22639480587605\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"440.39991288616466\" cy=\"161.01684554242132\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"286.37484882537944\" cy=\"170.99507761559238\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"522.1996709366038\" cy=\"145.80541813412393\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"329.9833421815147\" cy=\"166.1283660288269\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"368.65325062796495\" cy=\"164.91396734052617\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"397.0394358402336\" cy=\"155.8676795220344\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"336.080308148302\" cy=\"168.7125276205074\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"331.925629910039\" cy=\"165.8948609169787\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"292.22763216796295\" cy=\"171.8457361741385\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"278.9696954608102\" cy=\"170.2167083061533\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"412.34143605583284\" cy=\"158.78505818055004\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"423.5466065732844\" cy=\"159.6560019594849\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"465.9161829465704\" cy=\"154.77743530055463\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#21796a\" opacity=\".6\"/><path d=\"M82.00 259.24 L720.00 74.76\" stroke=\"#b96b38\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M82 50V274H720\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#789b8b\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"337\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#355a4b\">合成实验效率 / %</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>默认教学参数的实际计算：评价观测与预测 / 理想一致线。评价集MAE 4.81百分点；探索区间覆盖 93.33%；推荐预测效率 54.08%。图示由同包model.js计算，交互演示可改变参数重算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "岩心实验与效率标签",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点整理150—200组条件可对照的岩心驱替实验，逐组记录聚合物浓度、表活剂浓度、矿化度、驱替效率及实验批次，并关联岩心和测试条件。驱替效率作为回归标签，批次信息用于排查系统差异。本例以180组合成实验演示，120组参与回归、30组用于残差校准、30组用于评价，便于分别观察拟合与预测误差。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">配方与性能实验</span><span class=\"cl-s\">类型、浓度、界面张力、驱油效率</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">数百至数千组</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">原油与储层物性</span><span class=\"cl-s\">黏度、温度、矿化度</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">作为条件</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">矿场试验</span><span class=\"cl-s\">增油效果</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">少量真值</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">两类浓度、矿化度、驱替效率及实验批次</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/enhanced-oil-recovery\">DOE：Enhanced oil recovery<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "盐度作用与样本覆盖",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">盐度和配方相互作用强，岩心差异影响效率标签</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>主要难点是配方与盐度存在相互作用，岩心性质和实验批次也会影响效率，浓度接近并不保证响应一致。核带宽太小会过度依赖少数实验，太大又会抹平局部差异，筹备时需要检查各盐度区间和浓度组合的样本覆盖。应保留实验条件及批次信息，重点补做邻近资料稀少的候选，以实测结果更新局部响应关系。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">主动学习<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">高斯过程回归<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">实验设计<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "化学驱配方实验筛选",
      "lead": [
        "配方研究人员需要根据岩心实验比较盐度条件下的配方响应，在成本范围内筛选待复试组合。 本例使用教学合成资料，案例规模与处理口径如下。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "岩心实验",
          "180 组"
        ],
        [
          "训练 / 校准 / 评价",
          "120 / 30 / 30 组"
        ],
        [
          "筛选条件",
          "盐度、成本"
        ],
        [
          "配方变量",
          "2 项"
        ],
        [
          "均值基线 MAE",
